WEBVTT

01:41.440 --> 01:42.760
Sorry to interrupt.

01:42.840 --> 01:44.760
Where is Su Chengcheng?

01:49.640 --> 01:51.080
Has anyone seen Su Chengcheng?

01:51.160 --> 01:54.560
Before the rehearsal, Su Chengcheng
went over the schedule with us.

01:54.640 --> 01:56.360
Then Quan Shengtang arrived.

01:56.440 --> 01:59.560
She must've gone to do something else.

02:01.040 --> 02:02.440
What do you need from her?

02:03.040 --> 02:04.920
Something's wrong with Tang Qi,
and he needs her help.

02:05.000 --> 02:07.520
It's fine. You continue.
I'll go check somewhere else.

02:07.600 --> 02:09.080
The subscriber you dialed is not answered…

02:09.160 --> 02:10.600
Why isn't she answering the phone?

02:16.280 --> 02:18.920
I'm a little tired.

02:19.000 --> 02:20.760
Can we take a break for now?

02:20.840 --> 02:22.520
OK, let's take a short break.

02:22.600 --> 02:23.600
We'll practice later.

02:23.680 --> 02:25.680
- Thank you.
- Thank you for this.

02:30.560 --> 02:32.040
TANG QI, MR. GU FROM TBC

02:34.360 --> 02:35.960
MR. GU FROM TBC

02:36.040 --> 02:37.480
You go ahead.

02:37.560 --> 02:39.360
I'll request a solo rehearsal later

02:39.440 --> 02:40.440
to practice my part.

02:40.520 --> 02:41.480
You don't have to be here.

02:41.560 --> 02:43.480
I can practice my part alone.

02:44.120 --> 02:44.960
Thanks.

02:49.320 --> 02:51.480
Are you sure something's wrong
with Tang Qi's eyes?

02:51.560 --> 02:52.480
Yes.

02:53.800 --> 02:55.160
I heard it from Gu Yu.

02:55.240 --> 02:56.840
I also verified it
with Tang Qi's assistant.

03:04.880 --> 03:06.160
You'll expose this.

03:13.280 --> 03:14.360
Dr. Tang,

03:16.120 --> 03:17.440
what kind of makeup

03:18.040 --> 03:20.040
would suit this outfit?

03:31.080 --> 03:32.280
A long, curved eyebrow suits you.

03:36.280 --> 03:38.160
That's the shape of eyebrows.

03:38.240 --> 03:39.520
What about the color?

04:04.640 --> 04:06.160
The color

04:06.240 --> 04:07.520
should match the makeup.

04:07.600 --> 04:09.440
It can't be decided before makeup.

04:09.520 --> 04:10.400
Right?

04:11.040 --> 04:12.000
Fine.

04:12.080 --> 04:13.600
Let's choose the makeup first.

04:16.560 --> 04:19.160
For ancient women's makeup,
the key is color.

04:19.959 --> 04:22.920
Dr. Tang, what do you think?

04:23.000 --> 04:25.080
Which lipstick color
suits my skin tone best?

04:39.040 --> 04:40.800
Why are you in such a hurry?

04:40.880 --> 04:43.640
Tang is the makeup guide,
not the makeup artist.

04:43.720 --> 04:46.400
Why not try on the clothes first?

04:46.920 --> 04:48.120
Stop wasting my time.

04:48.920 --> 04:49.960
Even if I change clothes,

04:50.560 --> 04:53.320
I probably won't get Dr. Tang's guidance.

04:57.040 --> 04:59.760
I heard Mr. Tang's eyes
can't see colors clearly now.

05:01.400 --> 05:02.760
Seems like it's not healed yet.

05:03.360 --> 05:05.240
I know a very good ophthalmologist.

05:05.320 --> 05:07.760
If needed, I can recommend them
to Mr. Tang.

05:07.840 --> 05:09.880
He can't see colors?
Isn't that colorblindness?

05:09.960 --> 05:12.600
- Right.
- Right, he's colorblind.

05:13.640 --> 05:16.600
The head of R&D at TBC is colorblind?

05:16.680 --> 05:18.720
Can we still trust their products?

05:18.800 --> 05:20.920
I'll broadcast live for you.

05:21.520 --> 05:22.960
No, we're fine.

05:23.040 --> 05:25.200
We're perfectly fine.

05:25.280 --> 05:27.360
I've always liked TBC products.

05:27.440 --> 05:29.680
They're good and affordable.
And they suit Asian skin tones.

05:29.760 --> 05:32.520
Should I remove them from my list
of favorite cosmetics from now on?

05:32.600 --> 05:33.720
No need to remove them.

05:33.800 --> 05:35.000
We're perfectly fine.

05:35.080 --> 05:36.160
No need to remove them.

05:36.240 --> 05:37.400
We…

05:37.480 --> 05:39.320
We're perfectly fine.

05:39.400 --> 05:41.320
Don't believe that nonsense.

05:41.400 --> 05:42.680
Okay?

05:42.760 --> 05:44.000
It's actually simple.

05:44.080 --> 05:47.360
If Mr. Tang can do
a makeup demonstration in public,

05:48.200 --> 05:49.840
all doubts about TBC

05:49.920 --> 05:51.800
will naturally be cleared up.

05:51.880 --> 05:53.480
Yes.

05:54.480 --> 05:58.640
- Please prove it.
- Prove it.

06:00.280 --> 06:01.640
Prove it.

06:04.560 --> 06:05.800
Mr. Tang, prove it.

06:05.880 --> 06:08.360
We have bought…

06:08.440 --> 06:09.720
Please prove it.

06:09.800 --> 06:10.640
Prove it.

06:10.720 --> 06:13.600
Prove it.

06:19.200 --> 06:20.280
Mr. Tang.

06:20.360 --> 06:22.920
- Prove it.
- Prove it.

06:23.000 --> 06:24.360
Mr. Tang.

07:07.320 --> 07:09.680
Mr. Tang, could you do a Tang-style makeup

07:09.760 --> 07:11.480
to go with this outfit?

07:28.400 --> 07:30.680
This is a special TBC makeup set

07:30.760 --> 07:32.160
for this offline event.

07:32.240 --> 07:35.320
We had originally planned
for this segment.

07:35.920 --> 07:38.360
Dr. Tang will demonstrate

07:38.440 --> 07:40.800
how ancient women did their makeup.

07:41.440 --> 07:42.760
Thank you, Dr. Tang.

08:01.240 --> 08:04.840
This is a typical Tang dynasty ru skirt.

08:06.040 --> 08:07.120
Today,

08:07.880 --> 08:10.680
we'll use the drunken makeup
to match this dress

08:11.560 --> 08:13.800
to highlight the atmosphere of the fair.

08:13.880 --> 08:17.920
Drunken makeup was very popular
among young women in the Tang dynasty.

08:18.000 --> 08:20.520
It can be considered
the influencer makeup of that time.

08:21.080 --> 08:22.440
It's also known as tipsy makeup

08:23.000 --> 08:24.280
or flushed makeup.

08:25.560 --> 08:28.920
To apply the makeup,
we start with a white powder base.

08:30.000 --> 08:33.039
Then, we should apply a vivid,
colorful rouge to the cheeks.

08:38.760 --> 08:40.440
Since it imitates a drunken beauty,

08:41.159 --> 08:43.080
the color has to be precise.

08:43.720 --> 08:46.320
Too much would make it look
like you're drunk,

08:46.840 --> 08:49.480
and too little would make it plain.

09:38.760 --> 09:40.120
Come on, Lin Yuan. Get ready.

09:40.200 --> 09:43.200
Three, two, one, go.

09:57.440 --> 09:59.040
Your performance is easy.

09:59.120 --> 10:01.360
If you don't get nervous tonight,
you won't make mistakes.

10:01.440 --> 10:02.640
The key is Quan Shengtang.

10:02.720 --> 10:03.880
His part is more difficult.

10:03.960 --> 10:04.880
It's better to practice more.

10:06.200 --> 10:07.200
Where's Quan Shengtang?

10:08.560 --> 10:10.360
He said he had to go back to the inn.

10:10.440 --> 10:12.840
I'm a little unsure about one position.

10:12.920 --> 10:14.640
Could you show me again?

10:14.720 --> 10:16.960
- Where?
- Just the last part.

10:17.040 --> 10:18.320
It's where it ends, right?

10:18.400 --> 10:19.720
I'll go find Quan Shengtang at the inn.

10:20.720 --> 10:21.720
Gu Yu.

10:22.440 --> 10:24.080
Don't leave yet.

10:25.240 --> 10:26.360
I'm a bit nervous.

10:26.440 --> 10:28.360
Could you be my audience?

10:28.440 --> 10:31.280
I need to get used to it,
so I don't get too nervous later.

10:33.600 --> 10:34.880
Please.

10:37.160 --> 10:38.360
Sure.

10:39.200 --> 10:40.440
Don't leave, okay?

10:43.880 --> 10:47.160
Chengcheng, I've tried my best.

11:22.000 --> 11:23.160
Use this.

11:23.240 --> 11:24.640
Pink bead flowers with tassels.

11:39.640 --> 11:40.480
Done.

11:52.280 --> 11:55.320
- So beautiful.
- So beautiful.

11:55.400 --> 11:57.120
- So pretty.
- So pretty.

11:57.200 --> 12:00.280
TBC Spring Makeup Set is a must-have.

12:00.360 --> 12:02.240
- Let's buy it.
- It's a must-have.

12:02.320 --> 12:03.840
I'll buy it too.

12:04.600 --> 12:05.720
Friends.

12:06.400 --> 12:07.240
See?

12:07.320 --> 12:08.920
It's all rumors.

12:09.000 --> 12:10.440
From staff to products,

12:10.520 --> 12:13.440
everything at TBC is top-notch.

12:13.520 --> 12:15.960
We hope you'll support us.

12:16.040 --> 12:17.960
- Sure.
- Sure.

12:18.040 --> 12:19.640
Of course.

12:19.720 --> 12:20.880
So beautiful.

12:27.080 --> 12:27.960
You're beautiful.

13:17.960 --> 13:19.640
Thanks for earlier.

13:21.520 --> 13:23.880
Director Zhang knows
that I can't see colors

13:24.560 --> 13:25.880
but doesn't know

13:26.800 --> 13:28.600
that I can see the colors on you.

13:32.600 --> 13:34.560
Gu Yu told me you've known it for a while.

13:34.640 --> 13:35.560
How did you know?

13:38.160 --> 13:39.920
That day I went to your house,

13:40.000 --> 13:41.400
I noticed something was off,

13:41.960 --> 13:43.600
so I secretly paid attention.

13:46.160 --> 13:48.000
I thought it was Quan Shengtang
who told you.

13:49.880 --> 13:51.280
Why would you think that?

13:53.680 --> 13:54.840
Besides you,

13:55.360 --> 13:57.880
I can see colors on Quan Shengtang too.

13:59.160 --> 14:00.640
So, I thought

14:00.720 --> 14:03.160
it was him who noticed and told you.

14:04.600 --> 14:06.560
Quan Shengtang and I are different.

14:06.640 --> 14:08.000
We have nothing to do with each other.

14:08.080 --> 14:09.680
Then, why is it that in my eyes,

14:10.200 --> 14:12.200
only you and Quan Shengtang have color?

14:14.800 --> 14:18.000
Tang Qi's inability to see colors
has something to do with me?

14:20.120 --> 14:22.160
I heard you saw a doctor.

14:22.240 --> 14:24.640
Did the doctor find a way
to treat your eyes?

14:26.720 --> 14:28.520
I found a way to heal my eyes.

14:29.560 --> 14:31.240
That's great. What is it?

14:40.960 --> 14:41.880
Is it related to me?

14:45.600 --> 14:47.400
Your eyes aren't just your problem.

14:47.480 --> 14:48.960
It affects the whole company.

14:49.040 --> 14:51.240
Stop hesitating and just tell me.

14:51.840 --> 14:54.080
If it helps you heal your eyes,
I'm willing to do anything.

14:57.480 --> 14:58.520
Intimate contact.

15:07.520 --> 15:09.160
Intimate contact?

15:14.480 --> 15:16.000
Tang Qi.

15:17.040 --> 15:18.240
Tang Qi.

15:28.960 --> 15:29.800
I understand now.

15:33.920 --> 15:34.760
No problem.

16:18.560 --> 16:19.480
You…

16:20.440 --> 16:21.760
What do you want to do?

16:56.640 --> 16:59.400
Can you see colors now?

17:01.480 --> 17:02.360
Yes.

17:28.400 --> 17:29.680
You can't see colors again?

17:37.120 --> 17:38.960
Intimate contact.

17:39.480 --> 17:43.400
The more intimate,
the more colors you'll see.

17:53.440 --> 17:55.720
Don't be mad. Please don't be mad.

19:09.840 --> 19:10.920
Can you see colors now?

19:16.760 --> 19:18.160
Don't be mad.

19:18.240 --> 19:20.120
Are your eyes healed or not?

19:56.800 --> 19:57.640
They're healed.

19:59.800 --> 20:01.520
I can see colors now.

20:07.280 --> 20:10.840
Since you can see colors, I will…

20:10.920 --> 20:11.760
I'll leave for now.

20:16.800 --> 20:17.800
Su Chengcheng.

20:17.880 --> 20:19.000
Su Chengcheng.

20:24.560 --> 20:25.480
Su Chengcheng.

20:26.000 --> 20:26.840
Su…

20:31.440 --> 20:34.000
CHINESE STYLE ACCESSORIES

20:34.080 --> 20:37.200
TBC LIPSTICK & ROUGH SHOP

20:45.040 --> 20:46.560
Where exactly is Quan Shengtang?

20:49.480 --> 20:50.680
You're being mean to me.

20:50.760 --> 20:52.880
I'm not being mean to you.
I'm just anxious.

20:52.960 --> 20:54.320
You're being mean to me.

20:54.400 --> 20:57.200
You're being mean to me!

20:57.280 --> 20:59.600
You're being mean to me for a man.

21:06.040 --> 21:08.200
What role are you playing
to buy him more time?

21:08.800 --> 21:10.840
Are you doubting me again?

21:12.080 --> 21:13.240
No.

21:13.760 --> 21:15.560
You're doubting me.

21:15.640 --> 21:18.320
How can you doubt me for a man?

21:21.000 --> 21:22.680
Where on earth is Quan Shengtang?

21:24.360 --> 21:26.200
No matter what happens,

21:26.280 --> 21:27.920
you have to tell me the truth.

21:29.560 --> 21:31.240
Quan Shengtang is not my boyfriend.

21:31.320 --> 21:32.720
How would I know where he went?

21:32.800 --> 21:34.760
Fine, I'll go find him.

21:37.680 --> 21:40.320
You're leaving me?

21:41.360 --> 21:44.600
You're leaving me for a man?

21:47.880 --> 21:52.480
How can you leave me for a man?

21:56.840 --> 21:59.440
If you'd agree to be my girlfriend,
I wouldn't leave.

22:09.680 --> 22:10.960
Sorry, I'm back.

22:11.600 --> 22:14.800
I ran into an acquaintance,
chatted a little, and lost track of time.

22:14.880 --> 22:18.480
Sorry, Mr. Gu. Sorry. Sorry.

22:19.000 --> 22:19.960
Sorry.

22:22.200 --> 22:23.640
Teachers, I'm back.

22:24.480 --> 22:26.760
- Sorry.
- Glad you're back.

22:28.640 --> 22:30.760
How hard it is to act like a lead actress.

22:30.840 --> 22:33.080
If it weren't for the performance,

22:33.160 --> 22:35.360
I'd wish Quan Shengtang
would just disappear.

22:41.200 --> 22:44.720
But your dramatic flair
is pretty captivating.

22:45.280 --> 22:46.480
I'm almost done practicing.

22:46.560 --> 22:48.200
Do you want to take a look?

22:48.280 --> 22:49.880
We're running out of time. Let's start.

22:49.960 --> 22:51.480
- OK.
- Take the sword.

22:55.040 --> 22:56.040
Be mindful of your strength.

22:56.640 --> 22:57.640
- Good.
- Good.

23:02.200 --> 23:04.880
I told you not to worry.

23:07.280 --> 23:09.160
How can you mock me for a man?

23:18.520 --> 23:19.760
I'm going to the rehearsal.

23:26.440 --> 23:28.600
TRAVELING THROUGH TIME
TBC FAIR DRESSING ROOM

23:41.920 --> 23:43.160
Wang Yi.

23:43.240 --> 23:44.160
Mr. Gu.

23:44.240 --> 23:45.800
Has Quan Shengtang's makeup been done?

23:45.880 --> 23:48.160
He's in the dressing room over there
and hasn't come out.

23:48.880 --> 23:50.240
Hasn't come out?

24:01.720 --> 24:02.840
Quan Shengtang.

24:04.560 --> 24:05.600
Quan Shengtang.

24:06.440 --> 24:07.760
Have you changed?

24:08.400 --> 24:09.560
Do you need help?

24:11.640 --> 24:12.600
Quan Shengtang?

24:13.720 --> 24:15.000
- Quan Shengtang.
- Mr. Gu.

24:16.440 --> 24:17.280
Don't worry, Mr. Gu.

24:17.360 --> 24:18.920
Quan Shengtang will be fine.

24:19.520 --> 24:21.280
There's half an hour
until the performance starts.

24:21.360 --> 24:22.800
I'll be ready soon.

24:23.400 --> 24:24.320
How much longer do you need?

24:24.400 --> 24:25.880
Ten to 15 minutes.

24:25.960 --> 24:26.880
Don't rush me.

24:26.960 --> 24:28.240
The more you rush,
the more I get flustered.

24:32.480 --> 24:33.640
OK, I won't disturb you.

24:33.720 --> 24:34.800
Thank you.

24:39.120 --> 24:40.760
I really like these clothes.

24:40.840 --> 24:42.160
They look great on me.

24:42.240 --> 24:43.160
Thank you.

24:43.680 --> 24:45.040
I really like these clothes.

24:45.120 --> 24:46.880
They look great on me. Thank you.

24:46.960 --> 24:47.800
RECORDING

24:55.920 --> 24:57.360
Is there anyone else inside?

24:58.320 --> 24:59.200
No.

24:59.280 --> 25:01.000
Well, he's talking to himself.

25:01.080 --> 25:02.720
This is his first time at a big event.

25:02.800 --> 25:04.400
He's nervous.

25:06.840 --> 25:08.520
I shouldn't have rushed him.

25:08.600 --> 25:10.400
- I'll go encourage him.
- It's fine.

25:10.920 --> 25:12.320
Lin Yuan is also nervous right now.

25:12.400 --> 25:13.840
You should go encourage Lin Yuan.

25:22.560 --> 25:23.760
BLUETOOTH

25:39.280 --> 25:42.200
TBC SPRING MAKEUP FAIR

25:50.600 --> 25:52.600
HAN DYNASTY

25:55.440 --> 25:56.760
WEI-JIN PERIOD

25:58.320 --> 26:00.320
TANG DYNASTY

26:09.360 --> 26:10.320
SONG DYNASTY

26:11.400 --> 26:13.000
YUAN DYNASTY

26:14.280 --> 26:16.120
Lin Yuan did all these paintings.

26:17.600 --> 26:18.560
I know.

26:22.320 --> 26:25.000
Su Chengcheng planned this event.

26:25.080 --> 26:26.480
I know.

26:32.920 --> 26:34.960
Do you two think I'm a fool or something?

26:35.040 --> 26:36.400
Do you think I don't know anything?

26:42.880 --> 26:44.360
TBC SPRING MAKEUP FAIR

26:44.440 --> 26:45.400
Bravo!

26:55.320 --> 26:57.200
AT THAT YEAR'S LANTERN FESTIVAL

27:04.080 --> 27:08.960
- The Detective!
- The Detective!

27:09.040 --> 27:13.760
- The Detective!
- The Detective!

27:20.960 --> 27:22.240
He's so handsome.

27:27.560 --> 27:32.480
The Detective! The Detective!

27:42.160 --> 27:43.200
Who are you?

27:47.280 --> 27:48.120
Mr. Gu.

27:48.680 --> 27:49.960
Have you seen Su Chengcheng?

27:50.040 --> 27:51.600
She was just here.

27:52.120 --> 27:52.960
What's going on?

27:53.040 --> 27:54.480
Call her if you can't find her.

27:54.560 --> 27:56.160
I've already called. She didn't answer.

27:56.760 --> 27:57.800
I'll try again.

28:10.520 --> 28:15.760
- Lin Qiaqia!
- Lin Qiaqia!

28:15.840 --> 28:19.440
- Lin Qiaqia!
- Lin Qiaqia!

28:22.080 --> 28:22.920
Lin Yuan.

28:23.000 --> 28:26.280
- The Detective's mother, Lin Yuan.
- I saw her.

28:26.880 --> 28:28.040
Glad you saw her.

28:39.240 --> 28:40.080
Sorry.

28:40.160 --> 28:41.960
I was checking the performance
in the audience area

28:42.040 --> 28:43.360
and didn't hear my phone.

28:43.440 --> 28:45.200
A prop in the original plan is broken.

28:45.280 --> 28:46.600
It might affect the stage effects.

28:47.480 --> 28:49.120
Switch to the magpie bridge in Plan B.

28:51.920 --> 28:52.880
Sure.

28:52.960 --> 28:54.440
Everyone, let's use
the magpie bridge for the finale.

28:54.520 --> 28:55.520
OK.

28:55.600 --> 28:57.680
ANCIENT COSTUMES GRACE THE PARK
ELEGANT ATTIRE AND DANCE EMBARK

29:10.000 --> 29:11.800
Have you found Su Chengcheng?

29:11.880 --> 29:13.160
WANG YI

29:19.720 --> 29:20.760
Yes.

29:31.680 --> 29:33.640
Is the silhouette of Quan Shengtang

29:33.720 --> 29:35.680
on the screen projected live?

29:35.760 --> 29:37.120
Of course not.

29:37.680 --> 29:39.600
This screen looks ancient,

29:39.680 --> 29:41.280
but it's actually electronic.

29:42.000 --> 29:42.840
The silhouettes inside

29:42.920 --> 29:45.200
were all pre-recorded by Su Chengcheng.

29:46.400 --> 29:47.680
So, Quan Shengtang

29:48.400 --> 29:50.320
doesn't have to perform now,

29:50.400 --> 29:51.240
and he's resting now?

29:51.320 --> 29:53.120
Yes. What's wrong?

29:57.400 --> 29:58.360
Nothing.

31:01.920 --> 31:03.080
SOUL DETECTIVE

31:32.840 --> 31:34.280
Where is Su Chengcheng?

31:34.360 --> 31:35.840
WANG YI

31:41.520 --> 31:43.760
Have you ever seen Su Chengcheng
and Quan Shengtang together?

31:44.360 --> 31:45.720
Together?

31:49.000 --> 31:50.600
It seems not.

31:52.600 --> 31:54.440
Whenever it's about Quan Shengtang,

31:54.520 --> 31:57.280
Lin Yuan gets evasive
and acts really strange.

31:59.000 --> 32:00.280
What are you two talking about?

32:02.840 --> 32:04.640
Su Chengcheng and Quan Shengtang…

32:05.320 --> 32:07.800
If one of them appears,
the other one will disappear.

32:07.880 --> 32:09.400
They've never appeared at the same time.

32:09.480 --> 32:11.120
Su Chengcheng doesn't have to perform.

32:11.200 --> 32:13.520
She must be backstage. Right?

32:24.800 --> 32:26.160
Hello?

32:28.440 --> 32:30.880
Mr. Tang, I've searched everywhere
but can't find Su Chengcheng.

32:48.240 --> 32:50.160
Vandai's plan backfired.

32:50.240 --> 32:52.120
Director Zhang
is definitely going to be fired.

32:57.200 --> 32:59.320
Everyone,
the latest statistics have come in.

32:59.400 --> 33:01.320
During this event,

33:01.400 --> 33:03.880
TBC's sales increased
by 118.52% year-on-year

33:03.960 --> 33:06.240
and 306.55% quarter-on-quarter.

33:06.320 --> 33:08.160
The total transactions on Tmall Beauty,

33:08.240 --> 33:11.400
Douyin Beauty, and JD Beauty
ranked first among domestic brands.

33:15.080 --> 33:16.120
Let me see.

33:16.720 --> 33:19.400
118.52.

33:20.520 --> 33:21.960
We're amazing!

33:23.560 --> 33:25.120
- Mr. Zhou.
- Mr. Zhou.

33:28.320 --> 33:30.400
- Let me see.
- Look.

33:31.720 --> 33:33.480
Really impressive.

33:38.280 --> 33:39.720
Mr. Zhou, what are you looking for?

33:40.840 --> 33:41.800
Where is Quan Shengtang?

33:41.880 --> 33:43.720
I want to thank him in person.

33:43.800 --> 33:45.400
Quan Shengtang?

33:45.480 --> 33:47.360
I haven't seen him since the performance.

33:49.840 --> 33:53.480
He's already back at the inn.

33:56.760 --> 33:57.680
Alright.

33:57.760 --> 33:59.680
You guys carry on. I'll leave first.

33:59.760 --> 34:01.440
OK, Mr. Zhou, goodbye.

34:02.040 --> 34:03.800
- Help them clean up, okay?
- Sure.

34:06.120 --> 34:07.360
- Hurry and look.
- Hurry up.

34:07.440 --> 34:09.840
- We're top-rated. Incredible!
- Wow.

34:09.920 --> 34:11.120
- You're amazing!
- Scroll down.

34:14.960 --> 34:16.360
Did you hear that?

34:16.960 --> 34:18.159
I heard it.

34:28.440 --> 34:30.159
Quan Shengtang isn't in his room.

34:30.239 --> 34:32.199
- Goodnight.
- Goodnight.

34:41.000 --> 34:42.639
I just sent Lin Yuan back to her room.

34:44.520 --> 34:45.880
After the performance,

34:45.960 --> 34:47.480
Quan Shengtang wasn't
with Lin Yuan anymore.

34:48.800 --> 34:51.080
It's true that one of them
always disappears

34:51.159 --> 34:53.520
when the other one shows up.

34:53.600 --> 34:55.520
They never show up together.

34:56.320 --> 34:58.360
When Tang turned colorblind,

34:58.440 --> 34:59.920
he could only see the colors

35:00.000 --> 35:01.920
on Su Chengcheng and Quan Shengtang.

35:04.280 --> 35:05.560
Su Chengcheng.

35:22.080 --> 35:23.000
Hello?

35:23.080 --> 35:25.560
Chengcheng, something's wrong.

35:25.640 --> 35:28.520
The event is over.
What could possibly be wrong?

35:28.600 --> 35:30.160
As soon as the performance ended,

35:30.240 --> 35:32.480
Gu Yu came to find me,
saying he'd take me back to the inn.

35:34.760 --> 35:36.680
Gu Yu was so eager. Did he confess to you?

35:37.680 --> 35:38.800
Su Chengcheng,

35:38.880 --> 35:41.360
you're the one in trouble, not me.

35:41.440 --> 35:43.200
Alright, continue.

35:43.280 --> 35:45.600
On the way, Gu Yu kept hinting,

35:45.680 --> 35:46.920
thinking he was being subtle,

35:47.000 --> 35:48.080
but who do you think I am?

35:48.160 --> 35:49.520
What kind of villain haven't I designed?

35:49.600 --> 35:52.200
Gu Yu is just like a villain.

35:52.280 --> 35:54.760
He's not smart
and treats me like a naive fool.

35:54.840 --> 35:57.720
He tried to trick me, but I outwitted him.

35:59.320 --> 36:00.200
Chengcheng.

36:00.800 --> 36:02.720
Gu Yu's suspicious
of you and Quan Shengtang.

36:03.640 --> 36:04.560
Where is Quan Shengtang?

36:04.640 --> 36:06.360
I want to thank him in person.

36:06.440 --> 36:08.440
He's already back at the inn.

36:11.800 --> 36:13.080
It's not Gu Yu who's suspicious of me.

36:13.160 --> 36:14.680
It's Tang Qi.

36:22.080 --> 36:22.920
You must be tired.

36:23.000 --> 36:24.520
You arrived early this morning.

36:24.600 --> 36:26.000
You should go rest earlier tonight.

36:26.080 --> 36:27.480
I'll handle the rest.

36:27.560 --> 36:29.200
OK, I'll leave it to you then.

36:29.840 --> 36:31.640
- Hurry up.
- OK, see you.

36:33.120 --> 36:37.240
SPRING MAKEUP FAIR

36:43.240 --> 36:44.200
Mr. Tang.

36:50.040 --> 36:51.360
Where is Quan Shengtang?

36:54.080 --> 36:55.880
Quan Shengtang is not my boyfriend.

36:55.960 --> 36:57.080
How would I know where he is?

37:00.440 --> 37:02.000
If I don't let you go,

37:04.000 --> 37:06.080
Quan Shengtang won't show up, right?

37:13.440 --> 37:14.400
Mr. Tang,

37:14.920 --> 37:16.960
I don't understand what you're saying.

37:17.720 --> 37:20.200
What's going on
between Quan Shengtang and me?

37:23.760 --> 37:25.240
I've always been wondering

37:25.760 --> 37:27.160
why only you and Quan Shengtang

37:27.680 --> 37:29.920
have colors in my eyes.

37:31.280 --> 37:33.000
You should know the reason, right?

37:37.680 --> 37:38.880
Mr. Tang,

37:38.960 --> 37:40.680
this is your psychological issue.

37:40.760 --> 37:42.080
You should ask yourself.

37:42.160 --> 37:43.800
You and Quan Shengtang…

37:44.320 --> 37:46.920
Why does one of you always disappear
when the other one shows up?

37:50.200 --> 37:52.600
It's like you two are sharing one body.

38:03.040 --> 38:04.360
Mr. Tang,

38:05.240 --> 38:07.120
your eyes just got better.

38:07.200 --> 38:08.480
Is your mind playing a trick on you?

38:08.560 --> 38:10.880
If you can't prove I'm wrong,

38:12.440 --> 38:14.320
then the problem isn't with my mind.

38:15.840 --> 38:16.720
It's with you.

38:22.240 --> 38:23.200
How do I prove it?

38:24.120 --> 38:27.000
I need to see you and Quan Shengtang
at the same time.

38:31.000 --> 38:31.920
Alright.

38:32.600 --> 38:33.920
I'll take you to him.

38:43.080 --> 38:44.080
Quan Shengtang.

38:44.160 --> 38:45.320
Where are you?

38:45.400 --> 38:46.880
Room No. 2, right?

38:46.960 --> 38:48.560
Go straight and turn left?

38:48.640 --> 38:50.600
Mr. Tang and I are coming to see you now.

38:57.320 --> 38:58.240
Mr. Tang.

38:58.760 --> 38:59.800
Mr. Tang.

39:02.480 --> 39:04.440
Mr. Tang. Hold on a second.

39:04.520 --> 39:06.760
I just finished eating.
I'll be there right away.

39:12.800 --> 39:14.480
Do you believe me now?

39:14.560 --> 39:15.800
After the performance,

39:15.880 --> 39:17.920
Quan Shengtang got hungry
and went out to eat.

39:18.000 --> 39:20.200
But you guys started getting paranoid.

39:20.800 --> 39:23.200
I…

39:23.280 --> 39:26.360
You… You're even more imaginative
than Lin Yuan.

39:31.760 --> 39:32.680
What's wrong?

39:32.760 --> 39:33.800
I…

39:34.640 --> 39:37.000
I feel a little dizzy and lightheaded.

39:37.080 --> 39:39.000
Maybe it's low blood sugar.

39:39.520 --> 39:40.840
Did you miss a meal?

39:41.480 --> 39:44.080
I was too busy to eat today.

39:45.280 --> 39:48.600
I have juice in my room.

39:50.760 --> 39:52.600
Su Chengcheng! Su Chengcheng!

39:57.120 --> 39:58.120
Su Chengcheng!
